  challenge aims to draw attention to the difficulties faced by nondrivers
  in accessing our communities across the country and to inspire decision 
 makers to address the barriers and gaps in our transportation system.\n</
 p>\n<p>\n  Aggies what can you learn by trying not to drive to for a week
 ?\n</p>\n<p>\n  Learn More: https://weekwithoutdriving.org/\n</p>
