X-LIVEWHALE-IMAGE-CAPTION:Aggie Green Fund Logo
X-LIVEWHALE-SUMMARY:<p>Want to see the real-world impact of the Aggie Gre
 en Fund? You're invited to the AGF Project Showcase\, where past grant re
 cipients will share how their projects are making Texas A&amp\;M a more s
 ustainable place.<br />\n<br />\nThis is your opportunity to hear directl
 y from the students\, faculty\, and staff who are turning innovative idea
 s into reality. You'll learn about a range of projects and from every cor
 ner of our campus.&#160\;<br />\n<br />\nJoin us to get inspired\, ask qu
 estions\, have a snack\, and celebrate the incredible work being done to 
 create a greener campus.</p>
END:VEVENT
