DTSTART:20251018T130000Z
DTEND:20251018T160000Z
LOCATION:Parking Lot 97 off John Kimbrough Blvd
SUMMARY:Stream Clean
DESCRIPTION:All Aggies who participate will earn FIVE entries into our CS
 M Grand Prize Giveaway (https://sustainability.tamu.edu/get-involved/csd-
 prizes.html) with winners announced November 7.Volunteers should wear lon
 g pants and closed-toed shoes\, as you may be walking through tall grass 
 and weeds. Each volunteer will be supplied with a pair of gloves\, alitte
 r picker\, and a garbage bag to assist with picking up trash and debris. 
 White Creek on West Campus will be the focus area.Participant Arrival Tim
 e/Location:7:45 a.m. inParking Lot 97 off John Kimbrough Boulevard. You w
 ill sign in\, pick up equipment and listen to a safety briefing before be
 ginning stream clean activities.To sign up\, go tohttps://signup.com/go/m
 cxOMta.Click on the "Sign Up" button (green button)Add your email address
 \, participant name\, number of spots (total number of participants)\, ph
 one number and select your t-shirt size from the dropdown menu.After comp
 leting\, click "Save" and "Done" (green button).Signing up a Group?If you
  are adding an entire group\, please add each person's name individually\
 , along with their contact information and t-shirt size. Select "Save and
  Add Another Person" (blue button) for each additional person's informati
 on. This enables everyone to receive updates about the event\, as well as
  any weather-related cancellations.
