 gies who participate will earn <strong>FIVE</strong> entries into our <a 
 href="https://sustainability.tamu.edu/get-involved/csd-prizes.html">CSM G
 rand Prize Giveaway</a> with winners announced November 7.</span></p><p><
 span data-preserver-spaces="true">Volunteers should wear long pants and c
 losed-toed shoes\, as you may be walking through tall grass and weeds. Ea
 ch volunteer will be supplied with a pair of gloves\, a</span><span data-
 preserver-spaces="true"></span><span data-preserver-spaces="true">litter 
 picker\, and a garbage bag to assist with picking up trash and debris. Wh
 ite Creek on West Campus will be the focus area.</span></p><p><strong><sp
 an data-preserver-spaces="true">Participant Arrival Time/Location:</span>
 </strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true">7:45 a.m. in</span><a class="
 editor-rtfLink" href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/xHwY41zabSG3cdaZ6" target="
 _blank" rel="noopener"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Parking Lot 97 
